{"unit_id": "LLYlab__DLT#card-zh", "repo": "LLYlab/DLT", "commit": "afdaf1c6a25d0b343e899b26472c818e2b1d4231", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "DLT 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 DeepSeek 工具插件，通过 Host 与浏览器端组件协作，提供文档处理、环境运行和会话费用信息。它注册环境查询、程序运行、工程构建及文档读写转换工具，并在界面显示每轮成本、账户余额和文档预览。文档操作涵盖 PDF、Word、Excel 与 CSV；环境工具可查询本机工具链并运行程序或 MSBuild。适合需要在 DSH 中直接处理办公文档或使用本机开发工具链的用户。余额查询需要 DeepSeek 凭据，文档引擎依赖本机 Python 与相关组件。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:896", "lib/client.js:1260", "lib/core.js:491"]}
{"unit_id": "LLYlab__DLT#card-en", "repo": "LLYlab/DLT", "commit": "afdaf1c6a25d0b343e899b26472c818e2b1d4231", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "DLT is a DSH web plugin for document work and local development tools. It reads, writes, and converts PDF, Word, Excel, and CSV files, and provides tools to inspect environments, run programs, and build projects. Its interface shows turn costs, account balance, and document previews.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:896", "lib/client.js:1260", "lib/core.js:491"]}
