{"unit_id": "LLYlab__DLT#feature-1", "repo": "LLYlab/DLT", "commit": "afdaf1c6a25d0b343e899b26472c818e2b1d4231", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "DLT 的文档读取功能：模型可读取 PDF、Word、Excel 和 CSV 内容，按文件类型返回文本、表格或工作表数据。通过 dlt_doc_read 提交路径及可选范围参数。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:1037", "lib/index.js:1066"]}
{"unit_id": "LLYlab__DLT#feature-2", "repo": "LLYlab/DLT", "commit": "afdaf1c6a25d0b343e899b26472c818e2b1d4231", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "DLT 的文档写入与转换功能：模型可创建或修改文档，并将 PDF、Word、Excel、HTML 等格式转换，也支持 PDF 页面渲染为图像文件。通过 dlt_doc_write 或 dlt_doc_convert 指定文件与操作。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:1123", "lib/index.js:1257"]}
{"unit_id": "LLYlab__DLT#feature-3", "repo": "LLYlab/DLT", "commit": "afdaf1c6a25d0b343e899b26472c818e2b1d4231", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "DLT 的本机环境工具：查询预设或探测到的编译与运行环境，并按环境运行程序或调用 MSBuild 构建工程。模型通过 dlt_env、dlt_run 和 dlt_build 工具提交请求。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:896", "lib/index.js:940", "lib/index.js:985"]}
{"unit_id": "LLYlab__DLT#feature-4", "repo": "LLYlab/DLT", "commit": "afdaf1c6a25d0b343e899b26472c818e2b1d4231", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "DLT 的会话成本显示：读取会话用量并依据 DeepSeek 定价计算每轮人民币费用，在对话回合尾部显示费用信息。用户可在界面展开查看明细。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:496", "lib/client.js:194"]}
{"unit_id": "LLYlab__DLT#feature-5", "repo": "LLYlab/DLT", "commit": "afdaf1c6a25d0b343e899b26472c818e2b1d4231", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "DLT 的余额卡片：浏览器端调用余额端点获取 DeepSeek 账户余额，并在页面浮层中展示状态；用户可点击刷新。需要配置余额查询凭据。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:589", "lib/client.js:369"]}
{"unit_id": "LLYlab__DLT#caveat-1", "repo": "LLYlab/DLT", "commit": "afdaf1c6a25d0b343e899b26472c818e2b1d4231", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "DLT 查询余额时使用 DeepSeek API 基址，并从凭据引用或 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY 环境变量取得凭据；定价数据也会从 DeepSeek 定价页面加载。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:87", "lib/index.js:603"]}
{"unit_id": "LLYlab__DLT#caveat-2", "repo": "LLYlab/DLT", "commit": "afdaf1c6a25d0b343e899b26472c818e2b1d4231", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "DLT 的文档引擎调用本机 Python CLI；文档转换还依赖相应 Python 包及本机 Office 或 Edge 能力，具体可用路径取决于本机环境。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/core.js:491", "lib/index.js:702"]}
